# Vendor CLI invocation log (packages/*/cli-log.*) and its rotated generation.
# Local operational history — never committed.
claude_commands.log
claude_commands.log.1

# NOTE: `claude.args` / `codex.args` were ignored here until the e2e fake-CLI
# shims were given an absolute capture path (task 76a37b38). They wrote via
# `$0.args` / `%~f0.args`, neither of which searches PATH, so a shim invoked by
# bare name wrote into the CWD — the repository root. Ignoring them hid the
# regression twice: the files were deleted once as "unreferenced fixtures" and
# simply came back. Deliberately NOT re-added: if an .args file ever appears here
# again it should show up in `git status`.
.hench/reviews/*.json
